            <span>LINE</span>
            <small>友だち・グループへ送る</small>
          </a>
          <a class="share-card x" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Farthur-show.com%2Fwalk-across-awaji2026%2F" data-share-x target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>X</span>
